{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02550","headline":"游清都观寻沈道士得清字 · 许敬宗","name":"游清都观寻沈道士得清字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽人蹈箕颍，方士访蓬瀛。\n岂若逢真气，齐契体无名。\n既诠衆妙理，聊畅远游情。\n纵心驰贝阙，怡神想玉京。\n或命余杭酒，时听洛滨笙。\n风衢通阆苑，星使下层城。\n蕙帐晨飙动，芝房夕露清。\n方叶栖迟趣，於此听钟声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}